@startuml TestingLayer2Contract
' SPEC source: cmd/proveo/main_test.go, cmd/proveo/golden_test.go, internal/contract/**
' Layer 2 — Go contract tests on real builders (replacing bash grep). No Docker.
' 2026-10-16: internal/runner's DockerRunArgs golden, internal/egress BuildPlan
' goldens and writeBrokerEnv/sentinel cases are DELETED with the docker+egress
' backend; the sbx builders (sandbox.Spec, TestSandboxPlanGolden) carry the lane.
!includeurl https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/refs/heads/main/proveo.iuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

' purpose: the Layer-2 contract lane — Go builders executed and diffed against
'          goldens, replacing grep-for-substring contracts
' covers: internal/contract/**
' covers: cmd/proveo/*_test.go
' covers: internal/backend/sandbox/*_test.go
' covers: internal/imagetest/**

title Layer 2 · Contract — Go builders + goldens (no Docker)

actor "go test ./cmd/... ./internal/...\n(mise test-go)" as Runner <<actor>>

package "Contract suites (Go)" as Suites {
  component "cmd/proveo\nproviderLookup · sbx plan goldens\nposture golden" as CLI <<app>>
  component "internal/backend/sandbox\nsandbox.Spec — Kit, argv, secrets" as RunnerPkg <<app>>
  component "internal/provider\nregistry pins · Detect order" as Provider <<app>>
  component "internal/run\nrequireSandbox · egress row · Kit allow" as EgressPlan <<app>>
  component "internal/workspace\nmount plan · EnvFileSource" as Workspace <<app>>
  component "shim / Dockerfile\nstructural asserts (Go)" as Struct <<app>>
}

package "Image suites (opt-in, -tags=image)" as Bash {
  component "internal/imagetest\nTestImage<Def> · live-LLM checks skip without keys" as Residual <<app>>
}

package "Assertion targets" as Targets {
  component "defs/*/harness.manifest · Dockerfiles\nmise.toml · tracked shell files" as Defs <<app>>
  component "internal/* (executed, not grepped)" as GoSrc <<app>>
}

Runner --> Suites
Suites --> GoSrc : call / golden
Struct ..> Defs : parse / contain checks
Bash ..> Runner : not on default go test path

note bottom of Suites
**Go-first:** contracts execute builders (sandbox.Spec, Detect, the posture
and plan goldens) instead of grep-for-substring on source. That catches
regressions bash needles missed (e.g. host .env keys not reaching the broker,
when the broker was proveo's). Deterministic; no Docker.
end note

note right of Bash
Image and live-LLM checks are Go since 2026-09-22
(host-shell-to-go P3). They need a built image, so
default go test never compiles them; the shell
contract wrapper is deleted.
end note
@enduml
